{"time": 1755673535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "484391635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"眨眨眼睛看着她，有些不知所措，\"...\""}
{"time": 1755673600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "784048155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“你们好呀~小白毛和小蓝毛”*双马尾少女转过头来看了一眼，又踮着脚调整了一下面具的角度"}
{"time": 1755673624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239208932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"小姐怎么称呼\""}
