{"time": 1755938686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078085993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“也是，情报这种东西没有单方面索取的道理。来做交换吧。我可以以我味真家的名誉起誓情报的真实性”"}
{"time": 1755938727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128898018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你想交换哪方面的情报”"}
