{"time": 1755939381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583932193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“哈”，良紫哑然失笑“如果没有那一群飞鸟的话，倒是有几分可信度”"}
