{"time": 1755943280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922801040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你从者的话是不是有点太多了”"}
