{"time": 1755949644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883217897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（找他要（）"}
{"time": 1755949654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295315720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（可能是萧炎）"}
{"time": 1755949665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258314371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不是雷神？）"}
{"time": 1755949682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176475370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（雷神背后只有披风）"}
{"time": 1755949745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198236063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(御主呢)"}
{"time": 1755949746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "694311235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没想到空龙真的是塔姆（）"}
{"time": 1755949759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808912300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（没有看到）"}
{"time": 1755949843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350775365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“对我来说已经完成了，在确认你们情报属实之前。”摆了摆手"}
{"time": 1755949853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790372326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1686469372]（）"}
{"time": 1755949962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489829939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "耸耸肩，\"您究竟想要什么地方的情报，作为交换，我想你还有一个约定的位置没有交换完成。\""}
{"time": 1755950229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1686911213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“我已经说的很清楚了吧，在确认了情报真实性之后我就会告诉你们，是你的御主自己出于厌恶拒绝了我的提案。现在不暴起发怒不过是看在剧目还未拉开罢了，滚吧，别出现在我眼前了”对方御主示意骑士赶人"}
{"time": 1755950399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306266009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走吧，也许过段时间他就自己走了，我们先去别处逛逛？表现的太想留下来也不太好”"}
{"time": 1755950415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859758521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "传音"}
{"time": 1755950449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475701162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "从者摇头“总督大人！恕我指出，剧院乃公共大众欣赏艺术文化之雅地，即便您贵为总督，在订下全场前也未有将人赶出之权利……此等横行霸道之举并非骑士所为，总督你也应当反思才是！”"}
{"time": 1755950506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525343390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（目测守序善）"}
{"time": 1755950552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796910092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“骑士，我已经主动远离了她们，坐到了远处，这次也不过是让她们回到原位而已”*御主"}
