{"time": 1756214861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "748242611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "传音，“趁现在，露露姐。”"}
{"time": 1756214949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "217084561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好”趁着闪光之时变成安安的模样"}
{"time": 1756215838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382542813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "光芒偃息，骑士从者明目张胆地观察着你[CQ:at,qq=1040972910]"}
{"time": 1756215893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742854159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“一直跟着我，骑士先生不累吗”"}
{"time": 1756216434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454988593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "义正言辞“剧场的催眠是尔等做的吗，操控无辜者意识，实乃邪恶行径！”"}
{"time": 1756216566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "944965606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？我们可没有催眠oh，只是简单的暗示，毕竟对平民出手可是会被教会通缉的”"}
{"time": 1756216614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744873114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“而这面镜子……使用黑魔法吞吃同伴么？如此残忍嗜杀，在开战后吾定会替天行道、诛灭你这披着人皮的怪物！”"}
{"time": 1756216666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467599360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呵....”有点想笑“阁下想象力还真是丰富呢”"}
{"time": 1756216701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316987978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“既然你觉得我攻击了他们，那你来攻击我为他们报仇吧”"}
{"time": 1756216791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997146582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“仅是暗示么……对平民的身体是否有害？况且汝等操控如此多平民难道便只是为了上演一出剧目？蔑视人的自由思想非正义之所为！”"}
{"time": 1756216841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088626110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“剧目？不懂你什么意思，我只是暗示门卫放我进去罢了”"}
{"time": 1756216919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510806295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我问你，你们怎么进去剧院的，明明闲杂人等不得入内”"}
{"time": 1756217077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "317356196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=316987978]“我会将此事鼎明于教会，汝便等着公正的裁决罢”"}
{"time": 1756217099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964301395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如你所愿，那骑士我问你”"}
{"time": 1756217109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706306757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果你冤枉了我，你该如何”"}
{"time": 1756217132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882877794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（用骑士信条攻击他）"}
{"time": 1756217143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96122616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“堂堂骑士因为自己的原因让平民蒙冤，是否玷污了你骑士的荣誉”"}
{"time": 1756217161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728278628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=510806295]“自然是依总督大人的贵族特权与吾受人爱戴的骑士身份”"}
