{"time": 1756217439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2116842858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=96122616]（）"}
{"time": 1756218168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041931774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "点点头，“汝大规模修改平民意识已是不争之事实，至于那吞吃之魔法，吾确实未感受到有御主或从者死亡之信号……看来并非邪恶的黑魔法？”"}
{"time": 1756218244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114538359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "摇摇头“汝身为参与战争且应召之女巫，显然也非平民”"}
{"time": 1756218260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026093253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“第一条也是诬陷”"}
{"time": 1756218277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733970166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“堂堂骑士没有任何证据便敢如此断言吗”"}
{"time": 1756218441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "581815967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“若非尔等大规模催眠，那些平民岂会在舞台上无休止地演出剧目？并且还干扰到了后续他们的正常工作”"}
{"time": 1756218487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1777634670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(花火呢)"}
{"time": 1756218498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1602192402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（干嘛）"}
{"time": 1756218516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "828113905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我等又不一定是唯一来剧院之人”"}
{"time": 1756218532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1823696114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且我从未与台前人员交互过”"}
