{"time": 1756218727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1837160706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我只对守卫施加了轻微暗示放我们进去，随后什么也没做”"}
{"time": 1756218807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64726075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我可不会伤害平民”"}
{"time": 1756218888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "79930635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“虽然我不喜欢你，但我和你一样，不会把无辜的人卷入在内”"}
{"time": 1756218914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898672848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "有些动摇，“那……汝等对剧院中之事是何人所为有什么头绪吗？”"}
{"time": 1756219116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829722389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇摇头“我也不是特别清楚，仔细想来，在我们来时，他们似乎就在一直不停的排练了，”"}
{"time": 1756219502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860744028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“看来此事为何人所为，吾暂且还无法下判断，只能先行鼎明教会或再行调查了……”"}
